<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting us about your disrupted journey from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We’re committed to getting you to your destination on time, however, bad weather, natural disasters, technical problems and other issues can cause flight delays and cancellations, and your safety is our first priority.<br />
<br />
We will always do our best to minimise disruptions and rebook any connecting flights on your ticket in the event of a delay. I'm sorry that that didn’t happen on this occasion, and that the delay and error made by our team affected your onward flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If accommodated add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I’m glad to hear that staff were able to arrange accommodation for you until the following day. If you need a letter explaining why your trip was delayed for a travel insurance claim, just let me know - I'm happy to help.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If had to source own accommodation add:-</strong></em>&nbsp;<br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear about the unexpected expense you incurred while delayed overnight. I’d be happy to look at your -accommodation/taxi/meal- costs.<br />
<br />
I’ve attached a form for you to provide your bank account details so we can process any refund for you.<br />
<br />
When you return the form and supporting documentation/receipts, please reply to this email to make sure the information is attached to your file for processing.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and I hope we can welcome you onboard again soon.</body>
</html>